# M9. Teleop: Confirm engages; a slow leader move is followed. A leader moved fast is normal while teaching
# (the follower just lags), but over 2x the teleop limit for 200 ms it holds and latches teleop_overspeed.
expect motion mode ready
key torque-on-left
wait 2100
key c
expect motion torque left on
key leader-match-left
key teleop-left
expect motion target teleop.start operator_cli
wait 2100
key c
expect motion command teleop.start started operator_cli
expect motion mode teleop
key leader-sweep-left
absent 1600 motion fault
key leader-jerk-left
expect motion fault teleop_overspeed leader_left shoulder_pan
expect motion command teleop.start faulted operator_cli
key q
